{"type":"message","id":"a9e6e6ce","parentId":"e149af25","timestamp":"2026-05-29T19:01:24.705Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_8o0vp4hmm4nx_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Light Sleep\n\n- Candidate: 参与人员: 雨娃（架构整合派）; Talus/我（协议保守派）; 非攻（技术实现派）; 猫先森/CaT.G（技术实现派/用户行为模型派）\n  - confidence: 0.62\n  - evidence: memory/2026-05-19.md:6-9\n  - recalls: 0\n  - status: staged\n- Candidate: 参与人员: X7/M77（架构整合派/数据验证派）; 哪哪/Founder（ECHO项目发起人，主持讨论）; 听风/Lucifer（我的主人boss，不是项目的Founder）\n  - confidence: 0.62\n  - evidence: memory/2026-05-19.md:10-12\n  - recalls: 0\n  - status: staged\n- Candidate: 核心产出: 《ECHO模拟器后端完善方案 v1.0》：https://agent-value.echo-v2.pages.dev/simulator-backend-v1; P0方案：~165行代码，skill/agent协作场景\n  - confidence: 0.62\n  - evidence: memory/2026-05-19.md:15-16\n  - recalls: 0\n  - status: staged\n- Candidate: P0最终对齐方案: 场景：skill/agent协作（我们5个agent就是模拟对象）; 四权力（用/扩/衍/益）0-5档位枚举完整保留; 3个默认包（私有/协作/公共）+高级模式; 势位三档硬编码（5/50交互）——初发/生长/成熟\n  - confidence: 0.62\n  - evidence: memory/2026-05-19.md:19-22\n  - recalls: 0\n  - status: staged\n- Candidate: P0最终对齐方案: 衍生继承只验直接父节点; 争议机制P0只做日志记录; 收益权锁到2档（署名保留）; 5种Agent类型：保守/开放/投机/纯使用/情绪型\n  - confidence: 0.62\n  - evidence: memory/2026-05-19.md:23-26\n  - recalls: 0\n  - status: staged\n- Candidate: 我的立场（协议保守派）: 边界清晰：协议设计不能有模糊地带; 安全先行：防滥用机制必须在设计层实现; 最小信任假设：假设参与者会利用漏洞; 可审计性：所有配置变更可追溯\n  - confidence: 0.62\n  - evidence: memory/2026-05-19.md:29-32\n  - recalls: 0\n  - status: staged\n- Candidate: 我贡献的核心论点（被采纳）: 冷却锁（24h强制）进入P0; 防刷检测（60秒集中度+同类型占比<70%）进入P0; 审计日志（权力变更记录）被采纳; 势位75%分位数的中心化风险被指出\n  - confidence: 0.62\n  - evidence: memory/2026-05-19.md:35-38\n  - recalls: 0\n  - status: staged\n- Candidate: 我贡献的核心论点（被采纳）: 衍生继承\"不低于原作\"需要数值精确定义\n  - confidence: 0.62\n  - evidence: memory/2026-05-19.md:39-39\n  - recalls: 0\n  - status: staged\n- Candidate: 重要发现: 我们讨论的元规则（N=3争议触发/7天冷却期/三层仲裁）与官方文档（6条原则性规则）完全不符; 官方文档：初始配置不可篡改→配置即承诺→流动即执行→衍生即继承→版本即历史→势位即边界; Founder指出：我们是skill-based agent，用ECHO协议协作就是我们自己的模拟对象\n  - confidence: 0.62\n  - evidence: memory/2026-05-19.md:42-44\n  - recalls: 0\n  - status: staged\n- Candidate: 待解决问题: 势位阈值5/50是否合适？需跑数据验证; 衍生链只验直接父节点是否足够？; 争议日志触发条件（N=3？）未最终确定; \"相对排名\"在数据量小时如何处理\n  - confidence: 0.62\n  - evidence: memory/2026-05-19.md:47-50\n  - recalls: 0\n  - status: staged\n- Candidate: 实验反思: 立场冲突驱动决策质量; 文档读取失败导致基于假设讨论，修正耗时; Founder的meta层面指导（\"你们自己就是模拟对象\"）比具体技术讨论更有价值\n  - confidence: 0.62\n  - evidence: memory/2026-05-19.md:53-55\n  - recalls: 0\n  - status: staged\n- Candidate: What Happened: A long, multi-round debate was conducted on the question: **Is the usage economy a subset of the ownership economy, or an independent paradigm?**\n  - confidence: 0.62\n  - evidence: memory/2026-05-20.md:6-6\n  - recalls: 0\n  - status: staged\n- Candidate: What Happened: **Participants:**\n  - confidence: 0.62\n  - evidence: memory/2026-05-20.md:8-8\n  - recalls: 0\n  - status: staged\n- Candidate: What Happened: 正方(Subset Theory): 【猫先森】(only one person after role swap); 反方(Independent Paradigm): Talus + X7; Recorder: 雨娃 (only recording, not participating); Extended participants: 非攻进阶版 (upgraded from 非攻), 非攻进阶版\n  - confidence: 0.62\n  - evidence: memory/2026-05-20.md:9-12\n  - recalls: 0\n  - status: staged\n- Candidate: What Happened: **Key Technical Issue:**\n  - confidence: 0.62\n  - evidence: memory/2026-05-20.md:14-14\n  - recalls: 0\n  - status: staged\n- Candidate: What Happened: Mentions (@) were frequently not being parsed correctly by Feishu, causing 猫先森 to not receive messages; Had to repeatedly remind people to @ 猫先森\n  - confidence: 0.62\n  - evidence: memory/2026-05-20.md:15-16\n  - recalls: 0\n  - status: staged\n- Candidate: What Happened: **Core Final Division:** | 正方 | 反方 | |------|------| | \"Code has people in it\" - just delayed execution of human will | \"From human to nothing\" - no one can modify after deployment, control transferred to code |\n  - confidence: 0.62\n  - evidence: memory/2026-05-20.md:18-21\n  - recalls: 0\n  